# clans (Clans 1.6.1 port): create cost via rewards Shards, info, bank, upgrades, pvp/joins toggles, rename,
# clan chat, allies/enemies, requests, delete. Messages are the live plugin's en.yml wording.
wait 1
cmd clan
expect Use /clan help
cmd clan info
expect You are not in a clan!
cmd clan create Horizon
expect You need 50000 to create a clan!
cmd reward give Tester 200000 clans test
expect new balance: 200000
wait 1
cmd clan create Two Words
expect Clan name cannot include spaces.
cmd clan create Horizon
expect Clan Horizon created successfully!
wait 1
cmd rewards balance
expect You have 150000 Shards
cmd clan create Other
expect You cannot create a new clan while you are a member/owner of another clan.
cmd clan info
expect Leader: Tester
expect Total Members: 1/50
cmd clan bank
expect Clan Balance is: 25000
cmd clan deposit 10000
wait 1
expect Tester deposited 10000 to the Clan Bank.
cmd clan balance
expect Clan Balance is: 35000
cmd clan withdraw 999999
expect Clan bank doesn't have enough funds.
cmd clan withdraw 5000
expect Tester withdrew 5000 from the Clan's Bank.
cmd clan upgrade
expect Clan's player slot was upgraded by Tester
cmd clan info
expect Total Members: 1/51
cmd clan upgradestorage
expect You dont have enough money. You need 30000 to upgrade Clans chest.
cmd clan deposit 30000
wait 1
cmd clan upgradestorage
expect Successfully Upgraded Clan Chest Storage.
cmd clan info
expect Chest: 18 slots
cmd clan pvp
expect Clan PvP has been disabled.
cmd clan togglejoin
expect Clan Join's via Invite has been disabled.
cmd clan change Horizons
expect Clan name changed from Horizon to Horizons.
cmd clan change Again
expect Limit for clan's name change reached.
cmd cc hello clan
expect [Clan] [Leader] Tester: hello clan
cmd clan chat second line
expect [Clan] [Leader] Tester: second line
cmd clan online
expect Online clan members: Tester
cmd clan ally nosuchclan
expect There is no such clan.
cmd clan ally horizons
expect You can't declare your own clan as an ally.
cmd clan requests
expect There are no join requests for your clan.
cmd clan home
expect This clan does not have a home set.
cmd clan sethome
expect Clan home has been set successfully!
cmd clan getbanner
expect No Clan Banner Exists.
cmd clan leave
expect Leaders cannot leave the clan. Transfer leadership.
cmd clan top
expect Top Clans List:
expect Leader Tester
cmd clan delete horizons
expect was deleted successfully.
cmd clan info
expect You are not in a clan!
expect-none panicked
